route-map rm_to_rr permit 500 
 description ** Allow all prefixes **
 match policy-list rp_everything
!
route-map rm_from_rr deny 100 
 description ** Deny prefixes from same block tagged as sink **
 match policy-list rp_sink
 match policy-list rp_same_block_same_asn
!
route-map rm_from_rr deny 110 
 description ** Deny block-scope prefixes from other blocks **
 match policy-list rp_block_scope
 match policy-list rp_other_block
!
route-map rm_from_rr permit 500 
 description ** Allow all other prefixes **
 match policy-list rp_everything
!
