!
route-map rm6_conn_to_bgp_blue permit 500 
 description ** Set attributes for blue IPv6 user access interfaces **
 set origin igp
 set community 163:55196 2002:8 2002:12 2002:100 2002:1005
!
route-map rm_conn_to_bgp_blue permit 100 
 description ** Set attributes for blue IPv4 loopback interface **
 match interface Loopback10
 set origin igp
 set community 163:55196 2002:8 2002:11 2002:62 2002:100 2002:1005
!
route-map rm_conn_to_bgp_blue permit 110 
